{"2026.6.13:P02-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>二元弱酸滴定与守恒关系</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 师大附中 · 第13题 · P02-Q13</div><h1>二元弱酸滴定与守恒关系</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：结合滴定曲线判断电离常数、水解及离子浓度关系。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/酸碱中和滴定</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/水的电离</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/弱电解质的电离平衡</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1 N~14 O~16 Na~23 Mg~24 Cl~35.5 Fe~56Co~59</p><p>13. 常温下，用<img src=\"chem-asset:40e480ded4a8ad803b48bb14df8e7618062b88a66ad7e0d06a3e14fb9f2de53b:0;\" style=\"width:117.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液滴定<img src=\"chem-asset:a341bf7a9d340acae64f35adda1dd4ae3b9c6f7d2d4015233069214de44f880e:1;\" style=\"width:162.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，得到<img src=\"chem-asset:61e19cfb5e177d9785144d8fe4313632c09a7a499f41bf0fef3d01da64d9cb3e:2;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:a257a39cdf60dfe52a233e0ee06a909026b6dd687ce0eb717a1fa4788bd071d0:3;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:51c4b06a3279d196c3db33adaa1c34583563248734b563b371e0b77ae3a9b9a5:4;\" style=\"width:215.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的关系如图所示。下列叙述正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:cc1d1412ac0609cc54556dae105669461ac4b09661c57b4badea4ff7f101a371:5;\" style=\"width:337.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 水的电离程度：<img src=\"chem-asset:f558b40d893c66aa0939193dbea187554508ea473ea9d3daa08ed7a230a3bbf1:6;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 若向M点溶液滴加<img src=\"chem-asset:83184afc4101abddb4bd07a5e9dd1007a0996bb3800217a8037c36de86538c0d:7;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液时，<img src=\"chem-asset:6dd0d6be71e52c4940cf4be7a560034e4527f03d7becc5b7118c1c85e21390e5:8;\" style=\"width:191.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的值保持不变</p><p>C. 浓度均为<img src=\"chem-asset:72e72b2de8162238ddeb0bfc10270f1d56672ccc3ddeffb181763ece9bd05b2e:9;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:8bfb5f3b390f2e8718cf23ace6b29af4fe51308da20efa92b5de0d81c6c98e4d:10;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:fd6f2c907876cfa6871a70b85eade51140b475eaade97b4f61363abfff36a8a5:11;\" style=\"width:42.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的混合液中：<img src=\"chem-asset:db334177d5e92d88ac18f5920d45615dfb128c676446945f9a1a2681244242b1:12;\" style=\"width:124.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:886548a1e134072eefa0e804aa7daad3c372e2e31b59ad4e12dcc3edd4d183e1:13;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">点溶液，<img src=\"chem-asset:916828c60f296a72cca8c62ee18f18651217477ffe929621c0e609faa7a57490:14;\" style=\"width:245.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】M点正好生成NaHA，N点溶液成分为Na<sub>2</sub>A；H<sub>2</sub>A的K<sub>a1</sub>&gt;K<sub>a2</sub>，K<sub>a1</sub>=<img src=\"chem-asset:02d3db446b2060a986450855a6e8641b1464bf4749b7b53ef286a155c8ce8a02:15;\" style=\"width:111.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，K<sub>a2</sub>=<img src=\"chem-asset:643b9f707506fa1538f2eb1201d75fd988b2ccddea08c2364dcbfbb1c37784cc:16;\" style=\"width:107.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，c(H<sup>+</sup>)浓度相同时，<img src=\"chem-asset:c973bf664270101d13790c8b1ab447c5ce439fb87dbb7040235afa1181165791:17;\" style=\"width:59.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:2c01a2a93bf70a76d3b61c0fe1b1819f552ff44a59db8557fb5f2fbc19f248d1:18;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，-lg<img src=\"chem-asset:c973bf664270101d13790c8b1ab447c5ce439fb87dbb7040235afa1181165791:17;\" style=\"width:59.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&lt;-lg<img src=\"chem-asset:2c01a2a93bf70a76d3b61c0fe1b1819f552ff44a59db8557fb5f2fbc19f248d1:18;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，m曲线代表-lg<img src=\"chem-asset:c973bf664270101d13790c8b1ab447c5ce439fb87dbb7040235afa1181165791:17;\" style=\"width:59.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与pH关系，n曲线代表-lg<img src=\"chem-asset:2c01a2a93bf70a76d3b61c0fe1b1819f552ff44a59db8557fb5f2fbc19f248d1:18;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与pH关系。</p><p>【详解】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:886548a1e134072eefa0e804aa7daad3c372e2e31b59ad4e12dcc3edd4d183e1:13;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">点溶质为<img src=\"chem-asset:b666af268543d75cee5207c9f302ccd4f4ba4ef750bebe34024de659c5f5f96f:19;\" style=\"width:42.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:ecef135a973a117b61d8d84a0d488d1d5d21fe17dc70dac49e36e869b532e972:20;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">只水解，促进水的电离，故<img src=\"chem-asset:886548a1e134072eefa0e804aa7daad3c372e2e31b59ad4e12dcc3edd4d183e1:13;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">点水的电离程度更大，A错误；</p><p>B．根据电荷守恒：<img src=\"chem-asset:fe99a5279e3f383114cf064a2e640e3170963aed9760bb9b642607675c0c51a3:21;\" style=\"width:311.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:1b3949c7604fe32dc1d0edcc5850879950a1ee6f5a962a8777bfd9a9e9f3b217:22;\" style=\"width:19.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">点为<img src=\"chem-asset:436f9589a0f184f3649cad17ec8a7acd1ba8099ab5fe78e1cf46e738eb5d1160:23;\" style=\"width:77.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:fd6f2c907876cfa6871a70b85eade51140b475eaade97b4f61363abfff36a8a5:11;\" style=\"width:42.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，滴加<img src=\"chem-asset:83184afc4101abddb4bd07a5e9dd1007a0996bb3800217a8037c36de86538c0d:7;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液时，<img src=\"chem-asset:d138c3bb86745f57c1b87104464545197cabc9558857b894e22c93ef331df4a7:24;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">不变，<img src=\"chem-asset:0822f53762f6af1d2b585dfb9b1a016b5874f298d79005eff3527f180818e73f:25;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">减小，<img src=\"chem-asset:6dd0d6be71e52c4940cf4be7a560034e4527f03d7becc5b7118c1c85e21390e5:8;\" style=\"width:191.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的值在减小，B错误；</p><p>C．由图可得<img src=\"chem-asset:8bfb5f3b390f2e8718cf23ace6b29af4fe51308da20efa92b5de0d81c6c98e4d:10;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:29acafa92d0b4698fb83d165ab7280faf77047af027236485ae30c2974c56898:26;\" style=\"width:74.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:bf82ce5c328ace995e5844bcd99479b891dfc9d8ac243f338c22716ddac19cce:27;\" style=\"width:76.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，均为<img src=\"chem-asset:72e72b2de8162238ddeb0bfc10270f1d56672ccc3ddeffb181763ece9bd05b2e:9;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:8bfb5f3b390f2e8718cf23ace6b29af4fe51308da20efa92b5de0d81c6c98e4d:10;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:fd6f2c907876cfa6871a70b85eade51140b475eaade97b4f61363abfff36a8a5:11;\" style=\"width:42.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的混合液中，<img src=\"chem-asset:d9ad99c1c892547e735df0a6f7d6b95bff279827ec6f5c32da63994ef167e4d1:28;\" style=\"width:35.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的水解常数K<sub>h</sub>=<img src=\"chem-asset:34df704286b9fcd8e15096ae7fc2f5c44e48898e6724c58cb558a0e8ab7d8ea8:29;\" style=\"width:135.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:8bfb5f3b390f2e8718cf23ace6b29af4fe51308da20efa92b5de0d81c6c98e4d:10;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的电离程度远大于<img src=\"chem-asset:d9ad99c1c892547e735df0a6f7d6b95bff279827ec6f5c32da63994ef167e4d1:28;\" style=\"width:35.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的水解程度，平衡时，<img src=\"chem-asset:db334177d5e92d88ac18f5920d45615dfb128c676446945f9a1a2681244242b1:12;\" style=\"width:124.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C正确；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:886548a1e134072eefa0e804aa7daad3c372e2e31b59ad4e12dcc3edd4d183e1:13;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">点溶质为<img src=\"chem-asset:b666af268543d75cee5207c9f302ccd4f4ba4ef750bebe34024de659c5f5f96f:19;\" style=\"width:42.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，质子守恒式应为：<img src=\"chem-asset:85dbf071cc63acfeec39fed4403337ea50501cba84218a59fd90598abb3443f8:30;\" style=\"width:253.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>答案选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南师范大学附属中学2026届高三下学期考前学情自测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南师范大学附属中学2026届高三下学期考前学情自测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南师范大学附属中学2026届高三下学期考前学情自测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E8%87%AA%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%